	(text "battery: chassis terminals B_TERM+/- (135 A port), both conductors once through the N-C-644025 ring (CM, 150 kHz-\n30 MHz, ARCHITECTURE 8.1), X 2.2 uF 1300 V at the varistor network, Y1 4.7 nF pole-PE_T (removable PE link\nfor the hipot). Board taps B_IN+ / B_IN- / B_T+ by short links."
